      "statement": "With k_type1(S_r) >= 3 UNSAT (Step 4A Mod-2 Triple-Block Parity Obstruction) and k_type1(S_r) == 2 unconditionally UNSAT (6/6 in 1+1+2+2 and 56/56 in 1+1+4, sols=0), every slice S_r (r in 0..6) around the 7 inner triangles T_0..T_6 satisfies k_type1(S_r) in {0, 1}. By Triality Reciprocity, H_type1 is a simple undirected matching on 7 (odd!) vertices, so sum_{r=0}^6 k_type1(S_r) = 2|E(H_type1)| in {0, 2, 4, 6}, forcing at least 7 - 2|E(H_type1)| in {1, 3, 5, 7} slices to have k_type1(S_r) = 0. Selecting such a Type-I-free anchor r* as root slice transports the full marked state into the 2,903 Type-I-free orbits (k_type1 = 0, free of any (h0, h1) anchor pair: 233/233 disconnected orbits in 3+3 [55], 4+2 [168], and 2+2+2 [10] certified UNSAT + 270/2,670 single-cycle Class 6 orbits certified UNSAT so far and 2,400 Class 6 orbits remaining in docs/CLASS6_BUNDLE_INDEX_AND_LEDGER.md), bypassing the 299-orbit single-slice 1+5 stratum globally."
